<title>USA: LTV contributes $60 mln to pension plans.</title>
<headline>LTV contributes $60 mln to pension plans.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>LTV Corp said Monday it contributed $60 million to the LTV Steel defined benefit pension plans.</p>
<p>LTV has contributed a total of $203 million in 1996, raising the average funding level of these plans to 89 percent using an 8-1/2 percent discount rate. The company has contributed more than $2.7 billion to its defined benefit pension plans since 1993.</p>
<p>LTV is the nation's largest producer of value-added, flat-rolled steel for the automotive, appliance and electrical equipment markets; a major producer of welded pipe, tubing and electrical conduit and of tin plated steel for the container industry.</p>
</text>
